ads/fae/image/asset/2228/xs_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_SoundCloud.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2228/sm_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_SoundCloud.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2228/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_SoundCloud.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2228/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_SoundCloud.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2228/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_SoundCloud.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2228/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_SoundCloud.jpg","Since its founding in 2007, SoundCloud has experienced explosive growth and become a cultural phenomenon. Today, SoundCloud is the largest online community of artists, bands, DJs and audio creators, and continues to disrupt the traditional media space. From the unknown and avant-garde to the world’s most prominent musicians, comedians, podcasters and more, creators are able to engage with fans in a way completely unique to SoundCloud. Music and other audio media have always been an inherently social experience, and SoundCloud’s social connectivity is a core element of the veteran platform. SoundCloud is truly setting the pace for the future of streaming and entertainment at large. ","SoundCloud is the largest online audio community where artists, bands, DJs and other creators control their content and engage with fans in a unique way.","SoundCloud - IVP Portfolio - Venture Capital for Top Media Startups","SoundCloud - IVP Portfolio ","The leading audio platform connecting users to the world’s largest community of music and audio creators",{"id":32,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":9,"assetUrlXs":9,"assetUrlSm":9,"assetUrlMd":9,"assetUrlLg":9,"assetUrlXl":9,"assetUrlXxl":9},"543","2013-01-01","https://careers.ivp.com/companydetail.php?cid=4122&v=20","Alexander Ljung, Kerry Trainor","/content/why-soundcloud-will-rule-the-digital-audio-wor